    "body": "No. It demonstrates how to set scoped environment variables, and thus are not meant to include the `starship timings` part. \r\n\r\nAs specific logs files are used for deduplicating log messages, you might also want to set `STARSHIP_SESSION_KEY`, [like the official init does](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/src/init/starship.nu#L2).",
