    "body": "\r\n> But the following line is literally included in the documentation and _does_ include the timings part.\r\n> \r\n> ```shell\r\n> env STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship timings\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n\r\nThat command temporarily sets `STARSHIP_LOG` to `trace` and executes `starship timings`. `starship timings` is not included in the env var. Perhaps the documentation could be improved to make that more clear.",
